@baseUrl = http://api.localhost:8000

### API key 1 authenticates keyauth-partner-a
GET {{baseUrl}}/partner
api-key: 1

### API key 2 authenticates keyauth-partner-b
GET {{baseUrl}}/partner
api-key: 2

### API key 3 authenticates keyauth-partner-c
GET {{baseUrl}}/partner
api-key: 3

### Missing API key: expect 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/partner
